# Project-specific

## Stack

- Project: GOLS Connect
- Language: TypeScript
- Framework: Next.js 15 (App Router)

## Paths

- App routes: `app/`
- Shared source: `src/` (`components/`, `lib/`, `styles/`)
- Tests: co-located `src/**/*.test.ts`
- Brand assets: `brand/` (symlinked to `public/brand/` for static serving)
- Scripts: `scripts/`

## Conventions

- Use `@/` import alias for `src/` (e.g. `@/lib/config`)
- Env vars via `src/lib/config.ts` — never hardcode secrets
- GOLS brand: CSS variables from `src/styles/brand.css`; logos via `<Logo />` only
- API routes under `app/api/`
- Database schema in `src/lib/db/schema.ts`; access via `getDb()`
